<p>ALWIDA, ALWIDA AY JAANE ZEHRA S.A. ALWIDA.</p>

<p>
1. TAAZIYA QAANE SABHI UTH JAAYENGE.</p>

<p>KAAHE KO EHLE AZA AB AAYENGE.</p>

<p>AB BICHEGI NA YAHAN FARSHE AZA.</p>

<p>2. AS-SALAAM AYE JAANE FARWA AS-SALAAM.</p>

<p>AS-SALAAM ABBAS E ZEEJAH AS-SALAAM.</p>

<p>DARD K GHAM KI CHAA GAYI HAR SOO FIZA.</p>

<p>3. HAQ ADAA HUM SE NA POORA HO SAKA.</p>

<p>HUM NA JEE BHAR KE KIYE AAH O BUKA.</p>

<p>KIS ZUBAA'N SE HUM KAHENGE AYE QUDA JJH.</p>

<p>4. ANJUMAN E ASGHARI KA LO SALAAM.</p>

<p>HAI YAHAN JO BHI SABHI KA LO SALAAM.</p>

<p>SABKE HAI TOOTE DILO'N KO YEH SADAA.</p>

<p>
5. AYE SOHAIL AB MAANG ZEHRA S.A. SE DUA.</p>

<p>HUM KAREIN AGLE BARAS PHIR GHUM BAPA.</p>

<p>GHAM SE TERE DIL NAHI SABKA BHARA..</p>

<p>ALWIDA, ALWIDA AY JAANE ZEHRA S.A. ALWIDA.</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RAZA ALI SOHAIL SAHAB.</h4></center></p>
